00:00:08.042 --> 00:00:11.578 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du masque dans les lieux

00:00:10.144 --> 00:00:12.947 size:53% position:73% line:53%
publics.

00:00:10.544 --> 00:00:14.314 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Aller chez la coiffeuse,

00:00:11.912 --> 00:00:15.716 size:53% position:73% line:53%
j'aimerais qu'on porte puorte pu

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.084 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de masque!

00:00:14.648 --> 00:00:18.485 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Dans des foules compactes,

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.853 size:53% position:73% line:53%
je vais le garder sans doute.

00:00:17.418 --> 00:00:21.221 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La pharmacie, l'épicerie,

00:00:18.819 --> 00:00:22.656 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les autobus, c'est sûr!

00:00:20.187 --> 00:00:24.191 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je vais le garder, moi j'ai

00:00:21.555 --> 00:00:25.559 size:53% position:73% line:53%
jamais eu aucun problème avec

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.927 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ça.

00:00:24.525 --> 00:00:28.328 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le port du masque va toutefois

00:00:25.893 --> 00:00:29.630 size:53% position:73% line:53%
