00:00:29.964 --> 00:00:33.434 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ELYSE BERGER PELLETIER,

00:00:31.298 --> 00:00:34.668 size:53% position:73% line:53%
urgentologue, Hôtel-Dieu, Lévis

00:00:32.566 --> 00:00:35.869 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Pour l'hôpital, à mon humble

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:37.104 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avis, on va le porter encore

00:00:35.002 --> 00:00:38.305 size:53% position:73% line:53%
longtemps.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:39.540 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tients COVID demeurent

00:00:37.438 --> 00:00:40.774 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nombreux dans les hôpitaux.

00:00:38.639 --> 00:00:41.976 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le virus a changé les moeurs.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:43.210 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On veut se protéger. Comme je

00:00:41.108 --> 00:00:44.411 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vous disais ; gastroentérite,

00:00:42.309 --> 00:00:45.646 size:53% position:73% line:53%
influenza, covid. On a

00:00:43.544 --> 00:00:46.847 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tellement de virus ces temps-ci

00:00:44.745 --> 00:00:49.316 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aux urgences qu'on va continuer

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:50.517 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à le porter. On en discutait

00:00:47.181 --> 00:00:51.752 size:53% position:73% line:53%
