00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:52.953 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on porterait toujours le masque,

00:00:50.851 --> 00:00:54.188 size:53% position:73% line:53%
je pense, en travaillant.

00:00:52.086 --> 00:00:55.389 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En Chaudière-Appalaches,

00:00:53.287 --> 00:00:56.624 size:53% position:73% line:53%
95 personnes infectées

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:57.825 size:53% position:73% line:53%
